            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maz’ ankūrayo, anshikana mu ntangaro, aherekeye i burārūko; anyinjiza mu nzu irimw’ ivyumba irābana na wa mwanya uciye hagati, irābana n’ingoro, ahahera i burārūko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uruhande rwarimw’ urugi rw’aharābana n’i burārūko, uburebure bgaho bg’ amakika bgar’ amatambge ijana y’ukuboko uciriye mu nkokora, ubgaguke na bgo bgar’ amatambge mirongwitanu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iyo nzu yari n’ amabaraza agerekeranye mu mirongo itatu, arābana n’ah’ amatambge mirongwibiri ho mu nyubakwa, kand’ arābana na wa musezero w’amabuye wo mu ntangaro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Imbere y’iyo nzu irimw’ ivyumba hār’ inzira, ubgaguke bgayo bgar’ amatambge cumi, hāri n’akayira k’itambge rimwe; kand’ imiryango y’ivyo vyumba yarāba i burārūko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ivyumba vyo hejuru vyarutwa n’ivyo hasi bo n’ivyo hagati mur’ iyo nzu, kuko vyakehejwe n’amabaraza yavyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuko vyubatswe mu mirongo itatu igerekeranye, ariko bidafise inkingi nk’izo mu rugo: bituma ivyumba vyo hejuru biba impfunda kurenza ivyo hasi n’ivyo hagati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Igisika c’ahahera inyuma y’inzu irimw’ ivyumba kirābana no mu ntangaro imbere y’ibindi vyumba, uburebure bgaco bgar’ amatambge mirongwitanu y’ukuboko uciriye mu nkokora. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuko vya vyumba birāba mu ntangaro, uburebure bgavyo bgār’ amatambge mirongwitanu; arik’ ubg’ ibir’ imbere y’urusengero vyo bgar’ amatambge ijana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musi y’ivyo vyumba hār’ icanzo, ahahera i burasirazuba, cācibgamwo n’abajayo bava mu ntangaro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu ntimba y’urugo rw’amabuye rw’inyubakwa ahahera i burasirazuba, na ho hār’ ivyumba, vyar’ imbere y’umwanya uciye hagati, imbere y’ingoro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inzira yaca imbere yavyo yasa n’iyaca imbere y’ivyumba vy’ aherekeye i burārūko; ivyo hino n’ ivyo hirya vyose vyari cabugerwe mu burebure no mu bgaguke, n’ imiryango yavyo yose na yo yar’ uburyo bumwe, n’inzugi zavyo ni nk’uko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inzugi z’ivyumba vy’aherekeye i bumanuko na zo ni ko zari zimeze. Ku mutwe w’ inzira, ari yo nzira yo mu nyubakwa irābana n’i burasirazuba, hār’ icanzo, cācibgamwo n’abajayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.6.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lew 6:16",
